              "JER.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 24.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.5+2CH.36.6+2CH.36.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 36.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.1.1+DAN.1.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 1.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eewuo ele rorei enetii Yeremia oipirta iltung'ana pooki le Yuda, tiatua olari liong'uan le Yehoiakim olayioni le Yosia, olaiguanani le Yuda (ilo apa olari le dukuya le Nebukadnesa olaiguanani le Babilon), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laa ninye etolikio Yeremia oloiboni le Nkai iltung'ana pooki le Yuda o lelo pooki oomanya Yerusalem: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Too larin tikitam oo kuni, ebaiki olari le tomon ookuni le Yosia olayioni le Amon, olaiguanani le Yuda, ometabaiki ena olong, eewuo ororei lo Laitoriani enatii nanu, nairorie nanu intae akurraki, kake eitu intae ining'ining'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitu ninye ining'ining'i neitu irugugu nkiyiaa inyi aaning, hoo neirriwaka intae Olaitoriani akurraki sinkan lenyena iloibonok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ejo ‘Embelekenyata taata, pooki ng'ae te intae, aing'uaa enkoitoi enye torrono o nkiaasin torrok, nibikibiki ti oriong ina kop apa naishoo Olaitoriani intae ebaiki apa o ntarasi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emipuo aasujaa kulie aitin aaisiaai niserememe ninche, aashu kintagorigoro nanu te siaai oo nkaik inyi. Nemaitaas nanu intae entorrono.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore eyia eitu intae kining'ining'i nanu, Olaitoriani ojo, pee kitumutumu intae aaitagoro nanu teina siaai oo nkaik inyi naar intae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Neaku nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani: Ore enkaraki neitu ining'ining'i irorei laainei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ura, kairriu nanu lelo oshon pooki le moikuape, Olaitoriani ojo, o Nebukadnesa olaiguanani le Babilon, osinka lai, naa kayau nanu ninche metaarare ena kop o lelo oomanya, o lelo oreren pookioomanita, kaidaikie nanu ninche katukul, naitaa ninche olkirutoto, o enkiputukuny, o enkurruna oo ntarasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 7.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.16.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.22+REV.18.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 18.22-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ake sii, kaiwuang'ie te ninche oltoilo le nkuenia o ltoilo le ng'ida, oltoilo lo loyamisho o ltoilo le nayami, enkiyutuyutore oo soito oo yutuyutishoreki o ewang'an o ltaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 36.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 29.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.9.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 9.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ena kop pooki keaku emutata o enkidaata, naa keisiaai kuna kuapi olaiguanani le Babilon ilarin ntomoni naapishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee elusoo ilarin ntomon naapishana, naitame nanu olaiguanani le Babilon o ina kop oo Kaldayo, tenkaraki entorroni enye, Olaitoriani ojo, aitaa ina kop mitil intarasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayau nanu shumata ina kop lelo rorei laainei pooki apa latejo nanu tialo ninche pooki toki naigero tiatua ena buku apa naibonoko Yeremia oloiboni le Nkai nkuapi pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore doi ninye nkuapi kumok o laiguanank kituaak naa keitayu rrindiki te ninche; naa kalaaki nanu ninche te risioroto oo nkiaasin enye o siaatin oo nkaik enye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkiguana e Nkai too loreren",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji ejo Olaitoriani, Enkai e Israel: “Aatiaka ninye nanu, Iwa iyie te nkaina ai ena kikompe e naisho e ngoro, nincho nena kuapi pooki naairriwaki iyie metooko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keok ninche nemera nerruoyo lukuny tenkaraki ilo alem lairriwaki nanu atua ninche.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naya nanu ina kikompe te nkaina o Laitoriani, naisho nanu lelo oreren pooki laairriwaka Olaitoriani metooko: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerusalem o nkanas e Yuda, ilaiguanak lenyena o lkituaak lenyena, pee eitaa ninche olmuaate o neitaa mitil o enkiputukuny o ldeket, anaa enatiu ena olong; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao olaiguanani le Misiri, o isinkan lenyena, o lkituaak lenyena, o ltung'ana lenyena pooki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o lelo pooki omon ootii atua ninche; laiguanak pooki le nkop e Usi o laiguanak pooki le nkop e Filisti (Ashkelon, o Gasa, o Ekron o ilo pisiai le Ashdod), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edom, o Moab o layiok le Amon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o ilaiguanak pooki le Turo, o laiguanak pooki le Sidon, o laiguanak lo lomanaa le naiposha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Dedan, Tema, o Busi, o pooki oo dung ilpijat loo lpapit lenye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o ilaiguanak pooki le Arabia o laiguanak pooki loo loshon ooshula oomanya olpurkel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o ilaiguanak pooki le Simri, ilaiguanak pooki le Elam, o ilaiguanak pooki le Amedi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilaiguanak pooki le moikuape oolakua o lootaana, obo te siadi o likae, o nena kitoriat pooki enkop naatii oriong enkop. Naa ore te siadi ninche neok olaiguanani le Babilon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nintoki iyie ajoki ninche, ‘Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel: Tooko, temerayu nilopisho, tabatatayu niming'il ae kata adumunye, tenkaraki ilo alem lairriu nanu atua intae.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naa teneany ninche eng'amu ina kikompe te nkaina ino aaok, nijoki iyie ninche, ‘Nji ejo Olaitoriani, loo lororani: Meeta nchere pee miokioko! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ng'ura, kaiteru nanu aas entorroni too nkanas naaipotieki enkarna ai, naa eilo iyie mintamio? Milo iyie mintamio, amu aipotoko nanu olalem lelo pooki oomanya enkop, Olaitoriani loo lororani ojo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore naa iyie, shomo imbonisho tigilunore ninche te kulo rorei pooki, nijoki ninche,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore lelo ootara Olaitoriani teina olong neponari ebaiki enkiting'oto nabo enkop ometabaiki enkae. Meishirakini ninche, aashu eiturrurrokinoi, aashu enukari; keaku ninche emodiei ti oriong enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enteyietu, intae ilairritak loo ntare, ninchirishiri, nimperiperara too nkurruon intae ilaitoriak loo ntare, amu ore nkolong'i eyiang'are inyi o sina linyi neetuo, naa ibatatata intae anaa ilmeregeshi gelunot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meetae esarunoto naitokini aata too luaat oo ntare, aashu eneisudoriyie ilaitoriak loo ntare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entoning, olkiyioi loo lairritak, o eyiolounoto oo laitoriak lo lturrur! Amu einyalita Olaitoriani eneirritishoreki enye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ilo turrur le seriani neitigiraki tenkaraki ina goro napi o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etung'uayie ninye orrumat linyi anaa olng'atuny, amu etaa enkop enye mitil tenkaraki ilo alem leilo oitorogonyisho, o tenkaraki engoro enye napi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
